This repository redistributes a subset of the SVG emoji artwork from
Google's Noto Emoji project (https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
LICENSE-noto-emoji.txt). The exact upstream commit is recorded in
UPSTREAM_COMMIT.txt.

Modifications made here, per Apache-2.0 section 4(b):
  - a curated subset of the upstream SVG files is included (skin-tone
    variants and country flags are omitted);
  - files are renamed from codepoint names (emoji_u1f3ea.svg) to
    descriptive names (convenience_store.svg) and organized into
    category folders, following the gemoji dataset
    (https://github.com/github/gemoji);
  - the SVG contents themselves are unmodified.

The installer and build scripts in this repository are separate works,
licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
